[{"title":"黄楼","author":"唐之淳","text":"东方明未明，残月光睒睒。\n首路黄楼南，楼鼓声紞紞。\n我来何苦难，日月徒荏苒。\n川行无全功，陆涉此其渐。\n桥危惊路折，牛颤畏坡险。\n仆夫又已病，衣破胫不掩。\n风凄手足皴，霜重语音惨。\n我非肉食者，安坐敢自慊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37322,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿州","author":"唐之淳","text":"我车何啍啍，驾出城东门。\n城小州事殷，应荅民力烦。\n夕驱荒庄北，香山含半醺。\n莽然百里内，宿草蔓平原。\n前经石桥阻，始见鸡狗喧。\n又闻衡门下，儿童诵王言。\n土儒不识字，训解失本源。\n下车使之前，父老咸骇奔。\n重为正讹舛，钦哉期勿谖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37323,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"固镇","author":"唐之淳","text":"汇河镇门东，河水清如苔。\n其原发湖涧，其流入长淮。\n是日天气和，惜此风日佳。\n试临清泠渊，洗我肮?怀。\n渔人四五舟，中流正徘徊。\n时复发清啸，白鸥无惊猜。\n我本垂纶者，结茅东海隈。\n一年苦行役，不上钓鱼台。\n顺流绝奔鳞，安巢无夭胎。\n局蹜尘土人，焉能与之偕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37324,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自徐抵宿道中纪事有怀北平颐庵公松轩公子","author":"唐之淳","text":"船上复车上，徐州仍宿州。\n不因河冻合，那起客乡愁。\n晓饭霜侵匕，宵眠月拥裘。\n家人裁小帽，邻伴饷乾糇。\n坂曲惊疑簸，川平稳胜舟。\n纼寒牛背涩，轴垫仆心忧。\n古迹迎人问，诗题隔日搜。\n计程常屈指，惜别屡回头。\n岂有欢倾盖，谁能怒挟辀。\n因思安稳客，文酒日风流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37325,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"车上","author":"唐之淳","text":"老牛羸仆费驱驰，远道黄尘日暮时。\n每为乘桥占去住，却因下阪识安危。\n五云宫阙徐王陇，千载英灵闵子碑。\n欲斧涧冰磨剩墨，驻车重写出关诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37326,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"徐王庙下作","author":"唐之淳","text":"好在徐王庙下邻，邻人出酒饮行人。\n自说王家多宠庇，差科不动是閒身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37327,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"凤阳府","author":"唐之淳","text":"青天雨黄沙，白日赤若血。\n孤城临长河，况在苦寒节。\n去城五里近，仄径又西折。\n税车槐屋下，几榻稍罗列。\n况乃公子贤，馈酒甚清冽。\n仆人半已睡，呼起沾口舌。\n饥寒固已慰，羁旅亦可悦。\n山鸟则在巢，家鸡则于桀。\n我异鸟与鸡，奔驰何时歇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37328,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将及凤阳奉怀南涧公子二首 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"王孙送我最多情，马过新城复旧城。\n莺弄晓声风正软，草铺春色雨初晴。\n坐中别酒巡巡换，卷里新诗字字生。\n明日相逢更相爱，为言军旅在幽并。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37329,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将及凤阳奉怀南涧公子二首 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"去时杨柳线藏烟，归日梅花雪满天。\n北镇山川行处别，东夷鼓角听来便。\n青年从事惭孙楚，白首穷经慕伏虔。\n喜得重过南涧曲，欲分淮水洗鞍鞯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37330,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"池河驿","author":"唐之淳","text":"前日中都雪，都人庆丰年。\n今日池河雪，寒冰在前川。\n平明集仆夫，饭熟犹晏眠。\n高呼强之饭，牛冻车不前。\n黄犊成素骊，乌巾为白毡。\n却忆荆山外，别有琼瑶田。\n去京尚十舍，去乡仍渺绵。\n安能讼滕六，旭日布九天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37331,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清流关","author":"唐之淳","text":"过阪当牵驴，过关当下车。\n下车当用扶，牵驴当用驱。\n同云蔽曾冈，积雪平丘墟。\n行客歌苦寒，羸童叹无襦。\n稍见迟日升，轻冰犹在须。\n仰怀多病母，长年卧茅庐。\n静言思奋飞，迫切危险涂。\n危险不足恤，菽水当何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37332,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道中怀故乡诸友","author":"唐之淳","text":"暗中栉发月中餐，驴足凌兢度晚山。\n残雪满川遗万玉，好峰留雾失双鬟。\n此身老去星霜改，远道归来岁月閒。\n想得故乡诸旧友，青绫高卧掩松关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37333,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁州逢王云庄谈蔡萝屋","author":"唐之淳","text":"旧事吁可怪，客乡闻亦惊。\n风波开贝锦，云路失鹏程。\n莫惜干城器，难忘伐木情。\n临岐无复得，知作贵州宾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37334,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到京得毛鼎仁金齿书","author":"唐之淳","text":"万里书来已二年，惊闻不死却悽然。\n家人纵有惟存半，别梦虽多不记全。\n目断蛮云心似雨，泪兼蒲墨字如烟。\n可怜谢野原头路，谁向春风扫墓田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37335,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自京还越道中杂占六绝句 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"脱却双轮换独轮，乘船人作坐车人。\n明朝又复乘船去，却畏风波不畏尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37336,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自京还越道中杂占六绝句 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"晓日苍凉带水烟，畏途行尽半平川。\n临流自顾戎衣笑，车马驴船过一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37337,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自京还越道中杂占六绝句 其三","author":"唐之淳","text":"毗陵郭外早行车，小店鸡声古庙鸦。\n栋树东边门巷曲，隔墙新见腊梅华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37338,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自京还越道中杂占六绝句 其四","author":"唐之淳","text":"数峰高拥见岧峣，一鹤长鸣破寂寥。\n欲过虎丘寻剑石，望亭亭上望枫桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37339,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自京还越道中杂占六绝句 其五","author":"唐之淳","text":"黄昏月出大湖东，霜叶无多也自红。\n一色金波三万顷，垂虹亭子正当中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37340,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自京还越道中杂占六绝句 其六","author":"唐之淳","text":"齐云楼上大飞沙，楚国祠前箭似麻。\n事业总随流水去，空馀人唱石榴花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37341,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"常中过乡中二僧官","author":"唐之淳","text":"去京三四日，乍喜见扁舟。\n塞梦犹惊马，诗怀却借鸥。\n耳边吴语熟，云外楚山稠。\n更得逢禅侣，羊车肯暂留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37342,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题叶贡士湖曲草堂","author":"唐之淳","text":"客来不骑马，反作艇子嬉。\n醉来不著巾，倒著白接䍦。\n门前一顷菱，个个如红玉。\n收取当秋租，食菱胜食肉。\n湖稻大颗粒，湖鱼三尺强。\n稻可饭朝夕，鱼可煮羹汤。\n东头贺监居，西头放翁宅。\n看渠作官归，与渠作相识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37343,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题汪季子煮雪轩","author":"唐之淳","text":"煮雪当山泉，松垆袅竹烟。\n玉花光欲动，蟹眼味初全。\n法自陶家得，经从陆羽传。\n几回寒夜渴，谋借剡溪船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37344,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送贡士会试","author":"唐之淳","text":"别酒频频把，离弦款款听。\n旧霜枫叶赤，新雨柳条青。\n月斧看修桂，牛刀试发硎。\n故山空蕙帐，谁照读书萤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37345,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画稻","author":"唐之淳","text":"稻田到秋熟，岁岁常食粥。\n食粥可疗饥，种田当及时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37346,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画菜","author":"唐之淳","text":"开畦分种味，插竹当垣墉。\n安得身无病，长为卖菜翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37347,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吊钱塘卢清源墓","author":"唐之淳","text":"三尺新碑处士坟，乡人犹解说清源。\n东阡西冢多金玉，不及卢家好子孙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37348,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋崔彦晖雪林小隐","author":"唐之淳","text":"羃䍥更氤氲，林居静不喧。\n昼光琴荐湿，玉气石床温。\n夜雨泉惊枕，春雷笋到门。\n看知书画法，幽趣许谁论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37349,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵彦徵晴双骑图","author":"唐之淳","text":"得鞚金羁不动尘，新蒲细柳曲江春。\n瀛洲学士参差是，十八人中见两人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37350,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"留别钱塘友人戴钱二公","author":"唐之淳","text":"每向天涯共忆君，及归来日又离群。\n故人暂得从头数，好句须留会面闻。\n西子湖边灯照月，李陵台下雪如云。\n一身万里寻常事，塞北江南几夕曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过江浦县与高昂霄联句","author":"唐之淳","text":"西收风正一帆开，江浦城高晓角催。\n初日晴分骆驼岭，五云光涌凤凰台。\n驿亭旗影藏新柳，野店醅香带落梅。\n北望醉翁亭子到，欲寻遗刻步苍苔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"溪暝深藏柳，坡晴湿护苔。\n只惊联骑去，不见一人来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"麦陇丛丛绿，梅香树树香。\n山禽惊客梦，村酒割人肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其三","author":"唐之淳","text":"虎过山风急，山家早闭门。\n遥怜未投宿，月黑正销魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其四","author":"唐之淳","text":"浮图连石磴，略彴枕溪湾。\n驴背东风里，遥瞻管店山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其五","author":"唐之淳","text":"人到说旌麾，前朝过下邳。\n自惭行旅滞，非是恋吟诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其六","author":"唐之淳","text":"春树留残叶，晴峰带宿岚。\n滁阳山水秀，人道似江南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其七","author":"唐之淳","text":"林密草纤纤，卑枝拂帽檐。\n春光来一月，犹畏晓霜严。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其八","author":"唐之淳","text":"公馆借吟诗，行厨送午炊。\n数株临水柳，曾得系金羁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其九","author":"唐之淳","text":"狭路转多歧，多歧可问谁。\n试询曾到客，犹似未来时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其十","author":"唐之淳","text":"独树庙门前，鸦巢挂纸钱。\n欲寻遗像问，尘没已多年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其十一","author":"唐之淳","text":"下阪复登岗，前看道路长。\n不知行几日，能得到淮阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁山道中杂题 其十二","author":"唐之淳","text":"宿草发新荑，沙乾叶未齐。\n待教寒食雨，绿映锦障泥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自濠抵邳杂诗四首 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"暖日轻风古道傍，平原宿草正茫茫。\n过桥驿听津亭鼓，隔水船窥估客樯。\n圯下无人邀孺子，小山有赋忆淮王。\n细思楚汉争雄日，此地今馀几战场。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自濠抵邳杂诗四首 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"河北三春雨，天南五夜雷。\n山川新气色，车马息氛埃。\n燕逐游蜂至，莺催候雁回。\n不逢沽酒馆，何以得衔杯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自濠抵邳杂诗四首 其三","author":"唐之淳","text":"山石支桥险似梯，下窥流水净无泥。\n水边多少垂杨树，著个黄鹂来上啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自濠抵邳杂诗四首 其四","author":"唐之淳","text":"红白花开宿莽间，长亭小店接村湾。\n行人未识邳州路，马首先看虹见山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜雀瓦砚歌","author":"唐之淳","text":"汉日欲没众星紫，老瞒干天扰天纪。\n身辞篡弑遗厥嗣，却付分香兼卖履。\n铜爵高台五云里，声色娱人死无已。\n西陵墓草青如洗，舞尘细逐歌声起。\n台倾土荒产荆杞，遗瓦深川良有以。\n豫章得之谀墓鬼，琢配翰墨象焦尾。\n仍铭其阳志其喜，砚工文奇称二美。\n陇西王孙武靖子，宝之不翅琼瑶比。\n芳春燕客陈棐几，冷电晴云照秋水。\n研辞释文拂尘滓，红丝无光马蹄毁。\n邺城狐嘷豫章死，一甓千年置邮耳。\n欲镌短歌愧无似，乞借挥毫删魏史。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋高氏苔竹轩","author":"唐之淳","text":"苍苔绿竹谁所怜，高君作轩苔竹边。\n三春雨湿锦纹乱，六月风寒丹凤眠。\n有时自引阶前鹤，踏破云根竹华落。\n有时自煮石铛茶，轻烟冥冥萦屋角。\n我来正值清明时，蜗篆生香入砚池。\n青葱色里无人扫，剥啄声中有客棋。\n我知此君爱幽独，亦欲依君结茅屋。\n乞借墙阴半亩苔，更植阶西数竿竹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登邳城楼","author":"唐之淳","text":"挂剑台前事已非，绊戈山下草离离。\n城门日没乌栖早，野渡风高客过迟。\n十万牛羊新部落，五千貔虎旧旌麾。\n泗河东接沂河去，曾与行舟记下邳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州八景 其一 岠峰霁雪","author":"唐之淳","text":"玉龙行处夜无声，北面峰峦失翠屏。\n天上白榆宁有种，人间瑶草不知名。\n青烧猎火朝烟湿，红露仙楼夕照横。\n记得塞天曾见惯，薰风时节到辽城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州八景 其二 仙掌晴霞","author":"唐之淳","text":"何处丹霞似赤城，仙人掌上最分明。\n若非玉女裁衣罢，定是天孙织锦成。\n孤鹜齐飞天欲雨，断桥斜映夜还晴。\n会须绝顶营茅屋，采作朝餐咽日精。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州八景 其三 圯桥夜月","author":"唐之淳","text":"泗水西边沂水东，留侯黄石有遗踪。\n一编不受秦人火，三寸终成汉室功。\n曙色苍凉茅店月，履声寂寞柳营风。\n我来圯下留多日，几度兴怀听漏终。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州八景 其四 磬石秋风","author":"唐之淳","text":"水滨浮石势参差，风急秋清出韵迟。\n总是虞廷春贡后，不同萧寺夜禅时。\n响连月壑蛟龙惧，静荅霜林虎豹知。\n何处钟声起迢递，分明律吕远相随。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州八景 其五 鹿湖烟雨","author":"唐之淳","text":"雨稀烟暝水增波，鸥泛春声入棹歌。\n杨柳人家茅屋小，鳜鱼时节钓船多。\n暗归浦溆锵环佩，密掩峰峦湿髻螺。\n定有仙人骑白鹿，夜阑来此奏云和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州八景 其六 沂水春澜","author":"唐之淳","text":"雪融冰泮发漪澜，望入河流杳霭间。\n杜若未生黄鸟起，夕阳犹在白鸥间。\n声翻煖浪沉芳树，色漾晴岚灭远山。\n春服已成来禊祓，傍花随柳欲忘还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州八景 其七 鱼亭晚钓","author":"唐之淳","text":"亭前不改旧山河，落日垂纶感慨多。\n客至已非金谷会，风来犹起晋时波。\n珊瑚摧折遗蒲柳，锦帐荒凉长薜萝。\n更莫临流奏长笛，渚花汀鸟奈愁何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邳州八景 其八 剑台野望","author":"唐之淳","text":"荒郊不见徐君墓，此地空闻挂剑台。\n三尺英灵如有在，九原魂梦亦堪哀。\n林烟拂水青萍合，山雨飞空紫电来。\n望极吴中忆遗庙，春风几度野棠开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"射狼曲","author":"唐之淳","text":"甲士重重旗簇簇，一色晴原春草绿。\n将军小队出峄阳，健如飞鹰不可当。\n马人传令弓人受，骍弓在前箭在后。\n士雄马肥弓力强，胆落北山双白狼。\n吕梁洪边鼓声起，毛血斓斑狼堕水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜国公大人奉诏北征","author":"唐之淳","text":"使节方临外，兵符忽自中。\n素心承一德，纶语冠群公。\n马熟茐河草，旗生瀚海风。\n晓占幽蓟色，云物霁崆峒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和忆邳城寓馆之韵","author":"唐之淳","text":"陆贾曾存越，班超解拓边。\n公方持羽檄，吾岂恋舟船。\n蒲叶迎旋旆，桐花落舞筵。\n明朝毡帐月，光照柂机眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中有作奉呈公相","author":"唐之淳","text":"喜得天风送去舟，还从楚尾识吴头。\n浪花白处鱼吹雨，梅子黄时麦弄秋。\n一派棹歌连觱篥，两行旌旆杂兜鍪。\n路人解说朝天马，昨日清明过泗州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅南涧公晚别后见寄之韵二首 其一","author":"唐之淳","text":"晚天相送不相随，正是初三月上时。\n想得到城门半掩，一帘灯火数联诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和荅南涧公晚别后见寄之韵二首 其二","author":"唐之淳","text":"寄来诗句慰情亲，首首清和字字真。\n不合王维合王建，前身多是盛唐人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四月六日宿方东轩观方集有作","author":"唐之淳","text":"星离叹暌乖，簪盍欣会晤。\n幸兹灯烛光，获睹铿鍧句。\n雄若河注海，纤若茧抽绪。\n静若禅士定，专若狞妇妒。\n朱弦閟郊坛，画戟森武库。\n高将踪汉苏，近或企唐杜。\n羁悰涤故烦，隽腹饱新饫。\n座有吴子贤，雅多延陵誉。\n众乐方具列，善听别音度。\n愧余窘行役，聚鲜别乃遽。\n坐席未及温，秣马已在驭。\n诗殊伐木吟，曲拟骊驹赋。\n时夏宵苦长，天凉雨如絮。\n城更犹隐楼，庭鸡忽号树。\n怅矣明发辞，馀音寄遐慕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":37386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]